SUMMARY:Tryon Palace Candlelight Christmas Celebration (~2 hr)
LOCATION:Tryon Palace\, 529 S Front St\, New Bern\, NC 28562
DESCRIPTION:Drive from Cary: ~115 mi\, ~2 hr\nDay trip: candlelit tours of 
 the decorated 18th-century Palace and the Stanly and Dixon Houses\, with a
  fife and drum corps\, costumed interpreters and a black-powder fireworks 
 show around 9:30pm. Dates and hours are from the Palace's own event page\;
  buy tickets early.\nPrice: Ticketed\; regular price not yet confirmed (ea
 rly-bird ended Oct 1). Non-refundable\, often sells out\nCategory: histori
 c reenactment\nhttps://www.tryonpalace.org/events/candlelight
URL:https://www.tryonpalace.org/events/candlelight
END:VEVENT
