SUMMARY:Yuletide by Lanternlight\, Historic Halifax (~1 hr 30 min)
LOCATION:Historic Halifax State Historic Site\, 25 St David St\, Halifax\, 
 NC 27839
DESCRIPTION:Drive from Cary: ~90 mi\, ~1 hr 30 min\nDay trip: an evening la
 ntern-lit tour of Halifax's colonial and early-American buildings\, decora
 ted for the season with costumed interpreters. Date and time are from the 
 NC Historic Sites calendar\; one listing gives the address as 101 N King S
 t\, so check before you go.\nPrice: $20 per person\, tickets on Eventbrite
  or at the site from Nov 1\nCategory: historic reenactment\nhttps://events
 .dncr.nc.gov/event/yuletide-by-lanternlight
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/yuletide-by-lanternlight
